`conjMap_iSup` says conjugation commutes with the supremum of a monotone family of Scott endomaps of the inverse limit, indexed by the natural numbers. A monotone family has directed range, and conjugation preserves that directed supremum.

`conjMap_incl_le_conjMap_succ` says that including the conjugation of a Scott endomap by the level projection and embedding into the next level stays below conjugation by the projection and embedding one level higher.
